## Key Concepts
- Fetch API, JSON rendering, minimal DOM diffing
- WebSocket lifecycle, message handling, reconnection strategies
- Service Worker lifecycle: install, activate, fetch event handling, cache strategies
- Backoff logic, race conditions, and offline UX

## Code Example
